# Per-directory attributes owned by M110. The root .gitattributes is bound by M105 and M106, and
# metamorphosis/, scripts/ and tests/ each carry an attribute file bound by M107. M110 follows the
# scheme M108 and M109 established: JSON evidence bound by raw bytes, text members by LF-normalized
# content.
*.md text eol=lf
*.json -text
